{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Texas Twist Poker 3: Bandit\u2019s Run</strong> is a poker-infused tile-puzzler with the strategic depth of a roguelike deck-builder. Saddle up and chase down notorious Bandits by combining unique Jokers and powerful upgrades to create the 10 best poker hands in a 52-card deck. Shop wisely between rounds to build a formidable deck and craft a winning strategy to hunt down the Bandit and break their curse. Get ready for a high-stakes adventure that captures the wild spirit of Texas!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2660\u00a0<strong>Endless Possibilities:</strong> Every deal, twist, and Joker reshapes your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2666\u00a0<strong>Deep Campaign:</strong> Face off against 50+ Bandits with unique curses, mechanics, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2665\u00a0<strong>Loads of Choices:</strong>\u00a0Use Jokers, Mods, Upgrades,  and Trinkets to create dynamic and heart-pounding synergies to beat the Bandits.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ Jokers, each with unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A baker\u2019s dozen of boosts for each Joker adding further abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ card variants to enhance your deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Upgrade cards to level up specific poker hands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 Trinkets to provide permanent buffs for your current run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2663\u00a0<strong>Immersive Experience:</strong> Dive into Texas culture and history as you hunt Bandits across the state. Enjoy the flavors, wildlife, and geography as you twist your way across Texas!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600310?t=1759442238","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600310/41ccfab